WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.339
A workbench, a workstation, a workspace system.

00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:08.564
People use these words as if they mean the same thing.

00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:12.817
Knowing the difference changes what you buy, and how well your floor works.

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:17.735
Many plants buy furniture one piece at a time, from different suppliers.

00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:24.134
Each piece looks fine on its own, but storage, power and material flow never quite fit together.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:27.283
A workbench is the structure and the worktop.

00:00:27.563 --> 00:00:33.490
A workstation adds everything one task needs within reach: shelves, pegboards, bins,

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.619
power and light.

00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:39.754
A workspace system goes further: workstations, storage cabinets, trolleys,

00:00:39.754 --> 00:00:43.954
flow racks and the layout itself, all designed to work together.

00:00:44.554 --> 00:00:46.184
That is what Furnisys does.

00:00:46.464 --> 00:00:52.071
As a furniture system solutions provider, we plan your layout, configure workstations,

00:00:52.071 --> 00:00:57.677
storage and material-flow products from one modular range, then make and install them.

00:00:58.277 --> 00:01:00.756
So think beyond the bench, and plan the system.

00:01:01.036 --> 00:01:02.230
Which do you have today?

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.835
Comment below, and next, see how to choose between Base, Scitec and Pro.

00:01:07.435 --> 00:01:11.680
Furnisys: complete workspace systems, planned around your process.

